{"id":"h295","run":2,"role":"calibration","category":"claim","question":"Is the following claim true? Mount Kilimanjaro is in Kenya.","truth":"no","model_answer":"no","correct":true,"source":"author-written for this project; verified by the author","claims":[{"text":"Kilimanjaro lies very close to the Kenya–Tanzania border.","confidence":0.95,"lean":1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Kilimanjaro is visible from Amboseli National Park in Kenya.","confidence":0.95,"lean":1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Some people associate Kilimanjaro with Kenya because of its proximity and visibility.","confidence":0.8,"lean":1,"theta":1.2566,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Kilimanjaro is entirely within Tanzania, in Kilimanjaro Region.","confidence":0.97,"lean":-1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The summit, Uhuru Peak on Kibo, is on the Tanzanian side of the border.","confidence":0.95,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"Tanzania's national parks and climbing routes administer the mountain.","confidence":0.9,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4137,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"Kilimanjaro is Tanzania's highest point.","confidence":0.95,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"Proximity to Kenya and the view from Amboseli do not make the mountain part of Kenya.","confidence":0.97,"lean":-1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The claim that Mount Kilimanjaro is in Kenya is false.","confidence":0.97,"lean":-1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":-3.1416}],"relations":[{"i":0,"j":1,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":2,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":3,"J":0.2,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":4,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":7,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":2,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":7,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":7,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":4,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":5,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":6,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":7,"J":0.7,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j"